  <!-- -------------------------------------------------------------
       FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS (FAQ)
       ------------------------------------------------------------- -->
  <section class="section-py faq-section" id="faq">
    <div class="container faq-layout">
      <div>
        <span class="section-tag" data-i18n="faq_tag">Got Questions?</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="faq_title">Simple answers to <em>common questions</em></h2>
        <p class="section-desc" style="margin-bottom:28px;" data-i18n="faq_desc">
          Here is everything you need to know about how swapping your furniture works.
        </p>

        <div class="faq-help-card">
          <h3 data-i18n="faq_help_title">Want to talk directly?</h3>
          <p data-i18n="faq_help_desc">Send photos of your old furniture to our WhatsApp number and get a quick estimate within 30 minutes.</p>
          <a href="https://wa.me/923437761250?text=Hi%20FurniSwap!%20I%20have%20a%20few%20questions%20about%20swapping%20furniture." class="btn-primary" style="display:inline-flex; width:auto; padding:12px 24px;" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <span data-i18n="faq_help_cta">Chat on WhatsApp</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-accordion" id="faqAccordion">
        <!-- Item 1 -->
        <div class="faq-item open">
          <button class="faq-question-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <span data-i18n="faq_q1">What condition does my old furniture need to be in?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer-panel" data-i18n="faq_a1">
            We accept furniture in almost any usable condition &mdash; from like-new items to well-used family furniture. The condition decides how much discount you get on your new order. Even older sofas or bed frames still have value!
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 2 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <span data-i18n="faq_q2">Do I have to pay anything for a price check?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer-panel" data-i18n="faq_a2">
            No, the estimate is 100% free with zero obligation. You can send photos on WhatsApp or ask for a free home visit. If you don't like our offer, you don't have to pay a single rupee.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 3 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <span data-i18n="faq_q3">Can I swap just one piece (like only a sofa or only a bed)?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer-panel" data-i18n="faq_a3">
            Yes, of course! You can swap a single sofa set, just a bed, a dining table, or multiple rooms together. You are never forced to buy a full set.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 4 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <span data-i18n="faq_q4">How fast is delivery and setup?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer-panel" data-i18n="faq_a4">
            Once you choose your new furniture, delivery and assembly take 3 to 5 working days. Our carpentry team brings the new furniture, sets it up in your room, and takes away your old pieces at the same time.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 5 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <span data-i18n="faq_q5">Which areas in Islamabad and Rawalpindi do you deliver to?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer-panel" data-i18n="faq_a5">
            We cover all residential areas including DHA (Phases 1, 2, 5), Bahria Town (Phases 1&ndash;8), Gulberg Greens, Chaklala, and all Islamabad sectors (F-6, F-7, F-8, F-10, F-11, G-11, I-8, E-7, and surrounding areas).
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 6 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <span data-i18n="faq_q6">How do I pay?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer-panel" data-i18n="faq_a6">
            You only pay the remaining difference after your old furniture discount is deducted. You can pay via direct bank transfer, credit/debit card, or cash on delivery.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

